#Mission Info

$Version: 0.10
$Name:  XSTR("Weapons Range", -1)
$Author: openspace
$Created: 07/26/26 at 00:00:00
$Modified: 07/26/26 at 00:00:00
$Notes:
Synthetic live-fire proving ground for the weapons slice: the player's
Subach against three inert Amazon drones. Events exercise hits-left,
is-destroyed-delay 0 (per-drone directives) and is-destroyed-delay 1
(the delayed range-clear). Parsed by retail's parse_main like any
campaign mission; tests/mission_check.sh keeps its extraction honest.
$End Notes:

$Mission Desc:
 XSTR("Live-fire weapons range", -1)
$end_multi_text

